The slow sample loop is not a mathematical blocker; it is rebuilding adjacency for every random coloring. I’ll cache the fixed shipping instance’s conflict neighborhoods for the measurement so the mandated 200,000 samples remain exact and reproducible without making every development cycle minutes long.
